{"title": "Turn Resistance", "pageid": 13448, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Turn_Resistance", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Death.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Generic_Death.webp/300px-Generic_Death.webp, /w/images/1/14/Generic_Death.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Generic_Death.webp/300px-Generic_Death.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/14/Generic_Death.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Turn Resistance</b> gives <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throws\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throws\">Saving Throws</a> against any effect that turns undead.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p><b>Turn Resistance</b> gives <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a> against any effect that turns undead. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ansur\" title=\"Ansur\">Ansur</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Balthazar\" title=\"Balthazar\">Balthazar</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Abazigal\" title=\"Echo of Abazigal\">Echo of Abazigal</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Amelyssan\" title=\"Echo of Amelyssan\">Echo of Amelyssan</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Illasera\" title=\"Echo of Illasera\">Echo of Illasera</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Sendai\" title=\"Echo of Sendai\">Echo of Sendai</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gerringothe_Thorm\" title=\"Gerringothe Thorm\">Gerringothe Thorm</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ghislev\" title=\"Ghislev\">Ghislev</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Greater_Zombie\" title=\"Greater Zombie\">Greater Zombie</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Malus_Thorm\" title=\"Malus Thorm\">Malus Thorm</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mystic_Carrion\" title=\"Mystic Carrion\">Mystic Carrion</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Oathbreaker_Knight\" title=\"Oathbreaker Knight\">Oathbreaker Knight</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Thisobald_Thorm\" title=\"Thisobald Thorm\">Thisobald Thorm</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Thrumbo\" title=\"Thrumbo\">Thrumbo</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Visage_of_Cowardice\" title=\"Visage of Cowardice\">Visage of Cowardice</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Visage_of_Greed\" title=\"Visage of Greed\">Visage of Greed</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Visage_of_Guilt\" title=\"Visage of Guilt\">Visage of Guilt</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Visage_of_Heartlessness\" title=\"Visage of Heartlessness\">Visage of Heartlessness</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Visage_of_Obedience\" title=\"Visage of Obedience\">Visage of Obedience</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Visage_of_Regret\" title=\"Visage of Regret\">Visage of Regret</a></li></ul>\n</div>    <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a> against any effect that turns undead.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202430\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.035 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 764/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3998/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2362/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 16/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1591/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643656/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   35.020      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   35.020      1 -total\n 28.15%    9.859      2 Template:Icon_text\n 26.27%    9.199      1 Template:Advantage\n 25.43%    8.904      1 Template:Icon_link\n 23.88%    8.364      4 Template:Trim\n 19.85%    6.952      2 Template:Hid